@host = http://localhost:7071

### 1. Submit a valid purchase order -> 202 Accepted { correlationId }
# @name submit
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalEntityId": "ABN-01",
  "supplier": "ACME Pty Ltd",
  "clientRequestId": "req-10001",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "TIMBER-90X45", "quantity": 120, "unitPrice": 7.85 },
    { "sku": "NAILS-75MM",   "quantity": 50,  "unitPrice": 19.90 }
  ]
}

### 2. Query status by the correlation id returned above -> 200 { state: "Accepted" }
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{submit.response.body.correlationId}}/status

### 3. Idempotent replay (same clientRequestId) -> same correlationId, no second publish
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalEntityId": "ABN-01",
  "supplier": "ACME Pty Ltd",
  "clientRequestId": "req-10001",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "TIMBER-90X45", "quantity": 120, "unitPrice": 7.85 } ]
}

### 4. Invalid: no lines -> 400 Bad Request { errors: { Lines: [...] } }
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalEntityId": "ABN-01",
  "supplier": "ACME Pty Ltd",
  "clientRequestId": "req-bad-1",
  "lines": []
}

### 5. Invalid: unknown legal entity -> 400 Bad Request { errors: { LegalEntityId: [...] } }
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalEntityId": "ZZZ-99",
  "supplier": "ACME Pty Ltd",
  "clientRequestId": "req-bad-2",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "S", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1 } ]
}

### 6. Unknown correlation id -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/orders/does-not-exist/status
